      "title": "fix(web): distinguish project filter from new project",
      "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\nThe sidebar project filter used the same folder metaphor as the adjacent new-project action, making the two controls difficult to distinguish.\r\n\r\n## Fix\r\n\r\nUse the existing list-filter icon for the project filter's unscoped state. Selected projects continue to show their favicon, and the search and action layout is unchanged.\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\n- `vp fmt apps/web/src/components/Sidebar.tsx apps/web/src/components/sidebar/SidebarThreadHeader.tsx --check`\r\n- `vp lint apps/web/src/components/Sidebar.tsx apps/web/src/components/sidebar/SidebarThreadHeader.tsx --report-unused-disab…",
